From: Darcy Phipps <dphipps@qnx.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Mar 2025 11:34:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 16/60] Get contrib/dvdnav working on QNX

dvdnav wanted to add `-lpthread` when building on QNX. There is no
libpthread so link failed.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific (from qnx-ports)

--- a/contrib/src/dvdnav/0001-qnx-support.patch
+++ b/contrib/src/dvdnav/0001-qnx-support.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+--- a/configure.ac	2025-03-05 12:07:50.339464331 -0500
++++ b/configure.ac	2025-03-05 12:08:08.888657927 -0500
+@@ -88,6 +88,8 @@
+     ;;
+   *android*)
+     ;;
++  *nto* | *qnx*)
++    ;;
+   *)
+     AC_CHECK_LIB(pthread, pthread_create,
+         [THREAD_LIBS="-lpthread"],
--- a/contrib/src/dvdnav/rules.mak
+++ b/contrib/src/dvdnav/rules.mak
@@ -26,6 +26,9 @@
 	# fix some bogus accesses
 	$(APPLY) $(SRC)/dvdnav/0001-Check-the-the-title-parts-read-are-available.patch
 	$(APPLY) $(SRC)/dvdnav/0002-Fix-access-to-title-not-found-in-array.patch
+ifdef HAVE_QNX
+	$(APPLY) $(SRC)/dvdnav/0001-qnx-support.patch
+endif
 	$(call pkg_static,"misc/dvdnav.pc.in")
 	$(MOVE)
 
